<title>USA: Malverne, N.Y., won by Fleet Sec.</title>
<headline>Malverne, N.Y., won by Fleet Sec.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fleet Securities, Inc., said it won $1.497 million of Malverne, N.Y., public purpose bonds, 1996, with a net interest cost of 4.92 percent.</p>
</text>
